    "page_body": "<p>Sunrise Public School is a co-educational CBSE school offering a balanced education that combines academic excellence with sports, arts and values.</p><h2>Our story</h2><p>Sunrise Public School started with a simple idea: learn · lead · inspire. Today a passionate team carries that promise forward every day.</p><h2>What we believe</h2><ul><li>People first</li><li>Quality without shortcuts</li><li>Honest, transparent communication</li></ul>",
